payload.message:
Two commits landed for iteration 8. The first covered 6 files (CollectCollectors, Streams, StandardTable, SimpleTimeLimiter, ByteStreams, BaseEncoding — ~114 bare calls fixed), the second covered 8 more files (Sets, TreeTraverser, Range, Predicates, ClosingFuture, CollectSpliterators, TreeRangeMap, ContiguousSet — ~66 calls fixed). Remaining high-count files include Collections2, TreeRangeSet, Longs/Shorts (primitives), Lists, CharMatcher, CharStreams, Multisets, Maps, Multimaps, and MoreExecutors.

